{"ref":"BDB, שֵׁת","hw":"שֵׁת","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁת</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> third son of Adam; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:25\" href=\"/Genesis.4.25\">Gn 4:25</a> (where expl. from √ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁית</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:26\" href=\"/Genesis.4.26\">26</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:3\" href=\"/Genesis.5.3\">5:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:4\" href=\"/Genesis.5.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:6\" href=\"/Genesis.5.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:7\" href=\"/Genesis.5.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:8\" href=\"/Genesis.4.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.1\">1 Ch 1:1</a>; Σηθ.—In <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּל־בְּנֵי־שֵׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:17\" href=\"/Numbers.24.17\">Nu 24:17</a> (poem in J), read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁאת</span> <em>tumult</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:47\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.47\">La 3:47</a>), or <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂאֵת</span> (v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָשָׂא\" href=\"/BDB,_נָשָׂא\", dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא</a>), cf. Gray.—ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁת</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שׁתה\" href=\"/BDB,_שׁתה\", dir=\"rtl\">II. שׁתה</a>.","next":"BDB, שָׁת","prev":"BDB, שִׁית²"}